BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Woodworking Level 2 Sept 8 [Tuesdays - 6 week Comprehensive]
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T130000
UID:ttl-11048158396609@ttlmarket.com
DESCRIPTION:Woodworking Level 2 at TTLMakerspace\n\n \n \n Note: This cour
 se requires previous completion of Intro to Woodworking\n\n In this course
  at TTLMakerspace\, you will use and expand upon the skills learned in Int
 ro Woodworking. Working in a small group with dedicated instructor\, you'l
 l expand your skills in two practical box-building projects designed to de
 velop deeper understanding of woodworking.\n\n Build up confidence in the 
 shop and learn new\, valuable woodworking techniques.\n\n \n Materials and
  equipment for all projects are provided with the course. \n\n \n\n Schedu
 le : \n\n Six three-hour weekly classes\, Tuesdays 10am to 1pm. \n\n Outco
 mes : \n\n At the end of this course you will have achieved the following 
 goals: \n\n \n- Become more comfortable milling rough lumber \n\n- Complet
 e mitered corners \n\n- Complete box joints \n\n- Use a spline jig \n\n- C
 omplete inlays \n\n- Install hinges \n\n- Apply finishes \n\n- Learn how t
 o plan projects efficiently with minimal waste \n\n \n Following this cour
 se\, you'll be certified to use the woodshop. And you'll be able to join t
 he growing community of TTL Makers sharing knowledge on our Discord commun
